    "enUS": {
      "description": "You have accomplished the impossible. The brood mother of the Black Dragonflight lies dead at your feet. Take her head and present it to the Highlord.",
      "dialogue": {
        "d5ae6d9ca87d6f22133a": "For so many years I was held under her captivating gaze. Finally, to see justice meted and the honor of Stormwind restored! Today, we celebrate this glorious victory!",
        "ebf53b4f9c7b2c29fe02": "By Uther's beard!"
      },
      "summary": "Take the Head of Onyxia to Highlord Bolvar Fordragon in Stormwind.",
      "title": "Victory for the Alliance",
